ass=\"lucide lucide-help-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"flex-1 font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] leading-relaxed\">How are costs and timelines for treatment in China estimated?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform \"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></article><article id=\"faq-11\" class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full flex items-start gap-4 px-5 md:px-6 py-5 text-left hover:bg-[#FBFCFC] transition-colors\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-help-circle text-[#1B4D3E] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"flex-1 font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] leading-relaxed\">How will my medical records and privacy be protected?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gray-400 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform \"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></article><article id=\"faq-12\" class=\"bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"w-full flex items-start gap-4 px-5